      "text": "runs/run-labeling-human-calibration-0929-round-01.yaml\nresults/run-labeling-human-calibration-0929-round-01/\n    runtime.yaml · result.yaml\n\nTicket and Result share one full name.\nPaths inside are Page-relative:\n    labeling/rounds/round_01/manifest.yaml",
