    {
      "id": "l5-rules",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 4098.5,
      "width": 1740,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2509245,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 2609245,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. A Page can enter Data › Preparation before a Labeling job exists.\n2. A View lists its own Run Types in step order; no row invents a Run.\n3. Every Run Type declares Skills; a card distinguishes declared from used.\n4. New Tickets use full run-corpus-… or run-labeling-… names.\n5. An item and its real Runs pick each other: a build, round, or discussion.\n6. Source-owned preparation has its own runs/ and results/; Labeling lives beside labeling/.\n7. Copying a prompt does not allocate a Run; unavailable types stay in the workflow map.",
      "originalText": "1. A Page can enter Data › Preparation before a Labeling job exists.\n2. A View lists its own Run Types in step order; no row invents a Run.\n3. Every Run Type declares Skills; a card distinguishes declared from used.\n4. New Tickets use full run-corpus-… or run-labeling-… names.\n5. An item and its real Runs pick each other: a build, round, or discussion.\n6. Source-owned preparation has its own runs/ and results/; Labeling lives beside labeling/.\n7. Copying a prompt does not allocate a Run; unavailable types stay in the workflow map.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
